---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 30 and a 5 s preStop sleep (deploy-graceful.yaml).
// Measured: `kubectl delete pod --wait` took 6.45 s with that manifest; the pod
// log shows "Shutting down" -> "in-flight requests left: 0". Scale: 26 px per second.
const W = 900, H = 300;
const px = (s: number) => 40 + s * 26;
---
<figure class="bep12f">
  <div class="bep12f-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="A 30 second grace period drawn as a timeline. For the first 5 seconds a preStop sleep keeps the pod serving while the Service removes it from rotation. Then SIGTERM arrives, uvicorn stops accepting, finishes in-flight requests, runs lifespan shutdown and exits at about 6.45 seconds. The remaining time up to second 30 is unused; only then would SIGKILL arrive.">
    <text x="40" y="30" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 30</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 30</tspan></text>
    <rect x={px(0)} y="70" width={5 * 26} height="40" class="seg a" />
    <rect x={px(5)} y="70" width={1.45 * 26} height="40" class="seg b" />
    <rect x={px(6.45)} y="70" width={23.55 * 26} height="40" class="seg c" />
    <line x1={px(5)} y1="56" x2={px(5)} y2="126" class="tick" />
    <line x1={px(30)} y1="56" x2={px(30)} y2="124" class="tick red-l" />
    <text x={px(0) + 6} y="94" class="in"><tspan data-lang-en>preStop sleep 5 s</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>preStop sleep 5 s</tspan></text>
    <text x={px(0)} y="146" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>still serving; the Service drops this pod</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vẫn phục vụ; Service gỡ pod này khỏi danh sách</tspan></text>
    <text x={px(5) - 6} y="52" text-anchor="end" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>SIGTERM</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>SIGTERM</tspan></text>
    <text x={px(5) + 8} y="190" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>stop accepting, drain in-flight,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngừng nhận mới, xả hết request đang chạy,</tspan></text>
    <text x={px(5) + 8} y="210" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>lifespan shutdown, exit: 6.45 s in the capture</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lifespan shutdown, thoát: 6.45 s trong capture</tspan></text>
    <text x={px(18)} y="94" class="in"><tspan data-lang-en>unused budget</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thời gian dư</tspan></text>
    <text x={px(30) - 6} y="52" text-anchor="end" class="sm red"><tspan data-lang-en>SIGKILL at 30 s</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>SIGKILL ở giây 30</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="stop" x="60" y="244" size={22} />
    <text x="90" y="249" class="note red"><tspan data-lang-en>if the app ignores SIGTERM, the pod waits the full 30 s, then dies mid-request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nếu app bỏ qua SIGTERM, pod chờ đủ 30 s rồi chết giữa chừng</tspan></text>
    <text x={px(0)} y="284" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>seconds: 0</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giây: 0</tspan></text>
    <text x={px(30)} y="284" text-anchor="end" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>30</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>30</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A shutdown is a budget of seconds, not an instant. The manifest spends 5 on waiting for the Service and about 1.45 on draining.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Shutdown là một ngân sách tính bằng giây, không phải một khoảnh khắc. Manifest dùng 5 giây chờ Service và khoảng 1,45 giây để xả request.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep12f { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep12f-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep12f svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep12f text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .bep12f .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep12f .sm, .bep12f .note { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep12f .in { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .bep12f text.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep12f .seg.a { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep12f .seg.b { fill: var(--gold); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep12f .seg.c { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep12f .tick { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep12f .tick.red-l { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.4; }
  .bep12f figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
